                                             ┏ Help — keys and actions (Esc closes) ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓
                                             ┃Search:   (type to filter the keys)                                               line 1/178 · ↑↓ PgUp PgDn ┃
                                             ┃All keys, including any you changed in the config.                                                          ┃
                                             ┃Current mode: conventional (switch in Settings, Ctrl+W ,).                                                  ┃
                                             ┃                                                                                                            ┃
                                             ┃── Global ──                                                                                                ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+Enter, F5, Ctrl+W e     Send the request (or start the gRPC call)                                    ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W x                     Cancel the running request or stream                                         ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W d                     Finish sending on a client/bidi stream (half-close)                          ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+S, Ctrl+W s             Save the request to its file (asks for a name if new)                        ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W q, Ctrl+Q             Quit Sendito                                                                 ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+N, Ctrl+W t             Open a new unsaved HTTP request tab                                          ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W g                     Open a new unsaved gRPC request tab                                          ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W c                     Close the current tab                                                        ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W n, Ctrl+PageDown      Next open request tab                                                        ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W p, Ctrl+PageUp        Previous open request tab                                                    ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W h, Ctrl+W Left        Focus the pane to the left                                                   ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W j, Ctrl+W Down        Focus the pane below                                                         ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W k, Ctrl+W Up          Focus the pane above                                                         ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W l, Ctrl+W Right       Focus the pane to the right                                                  ┃
                                             ┃  Tab, Ctrl+W w                Move focus to the next field or pane                                         ┃
                                             ┃  Shift+Tab, Ctrl+W W          Move focus to the previous field or pane                                     ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W ]                     Next tab of the focused pane (e.g. Params → Headers)                         ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W [                     Previous tab of the focused pane                                             ┃
                                             ┃  Alt+1                        Jump to tab 1 of the focused pane                                            ┃
                                             ┃  Alt+2                        Jump to tab 2 of the focused pane                                            ┃
                                             ┃  Alt+3                        Jump to tab 3 of the focused pane                                            ┃
                                             ┃  Alt+4                        Jump to tab 4 of the focused pane                                            ┃
                                             ┃  Alt+5                        Jump to tab 5 of the focused pane                                            ┃
                                             ┃  Alt+6                        Jump to tab 6 of the focused pane                                            ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+P                       Open the command palette                                                     ┃
                                             ┃  F1, Ctrl+W ?                 Show all keys and actions                                                    ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W ,                     Open settings                                                                ┃
                                             ┃  F4, Ctrl+W v                 Choose the active environment                                                ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W V                     Edit environments and their variables                                        ┃
                                             ┃  F7, Ctrl+W r                 Show request history in the sidebar (toggle)                                 ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+B, Ctrl+W b             Show or hide the sidebar                                                     ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W i                     Import a Postman collection or a curl command                                ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W u                     Copy the request as curl (secrets stay {{placeholders}})                     ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W f                     Pretty-print the JSON body / message                                         ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W z                     Maximize or restore the focused pane                                         ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W >                     Widen the sidebar                                                            ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W <                     Narrow the sidebar                                                           ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W +                     Give the request editor more height                                          ┃
                                             ┃  Ctrl+W -                     Give the response more height                                                ┃
                                             ┃                                                                                                            ┃
                                             ┃── Sidebar tree ──                                                                                          ┃
                                             ┃  Enter                        Open the selected request / toggle the folder                                ┃
                                             ┃  Right                        Expand folder                                                                ┃
                                             ┃  Left                         Collapse folder or go to parent                                              ┃
                                             ┃  n                            New request in the selected folder                                           ┃
                                             ┃  N                            New folder in the selected folder                                            ┃
                                             ┃  r, F2                        Rename the selected item                                                     ┃
                                             ┃  d                            Duplicate the selected item                                                  ┃
                                             ┃  Delete, x                    Delete the selected item (asks first)                                        ┃
